<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 310)</h2>
<p><b>Web voice notes play in the app, and important web notices can't be missed.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Voice notes recorded in the browser now play back inside Asobi — click play on the note like any other; the audio fetches and decrypts on demand.</li>
<li>Policy messages on the web (like original downloads being off) appear as a centered notice with an OK button instead of a thin top banner.</li>
</ul>
